sequenceDiagram
  participant API as HTTP
  participant Reader as SensorReader
  participant Calibration as CalibrationPolicy
  participant Quality as QualityRule
  participant Repo as QualityStore
  API->>Reader: read(sensor_id)
  Reader-->>API: SensorReading
  API->>Calibration: apply(reading)
  Calibration-->>API: Calibrated reading
  API->>Quality: assess
  Quality-->>API: accepted / hold / rejected
  API->>Repo: save(QualityResult)
